#: scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20142f5f31dfbd720c861aadfa1ea3ff18a051e883151ec05dbd2cc782e28b68
