msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D9031696_32C5_4F5B_AAC5_B715F70B4857"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I was searching for a way to get you out of the tower,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I encountered "
"and spoke with the three men’s shadows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quand je cherchais un moyen de vous sortir de la tour,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫j’ai rencontré les "
"ombres des trois hommes et j’ai discuté avec eux."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2A975FD6_1987_4531_B499_8F70E26A3456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 651476fa1eeea2028edc0583adb589a6fe1365c1550f51550ed8e69c523e57d6
