msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2A975FD6_1987_4531_B499_8F70E26A3456"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫So I guess... ⟪k:3⟫our first task is to earn Mell’s trust."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Alors, j’imagine... ⟪k:3⟫que notre première tâche est de gagner la confiance de "
"Mell."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7BB33D02_E8B5_4D6D_BA08_72D51A5A7020
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ad793a44789710a0e24de22bed7546654048ca495cb0f4a9b00603a1349693d
