msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7BB33D02_E8B5_4D6D_BA08_72D51A5A7020"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana’s death is in three days...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We have until then to get all three "
"keys..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La mort de Morgana est dans trois jours...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫On a jusque-là pour obtenir "
"les trois clefs..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6549EA6F_B9B1_4040_9379_5CDAA3BE5A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0b8edf4bd936df787fed86e9a27f8289530883bd0ba3cd7a8382d3cc1c1404b
