msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6549EA6F_B9B1_4040_9379_5CDAA3BE5A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It won’t be easy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I mean, we weren’t even present in this world until "
"today..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce ne sera pas facile.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je veux dire, on vient tout juste d’arriver dans "
"ce monde..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4293848C_4AD9_4E87_A2C6_4663BFA0DF86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fa15b2ba238c2c4c13380986672161a042e7e1d0c4d42bf5d1a28329a2dce5e
